{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-01_end","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-01","title":"会合","storyCode":"3-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"5058f05ec0387d731f8bff79598dc555f1a97f4a370137c1755c3273ae397b15","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"整合运动的渗透令人防不胜防，众人再次明确，首要目标是夺回米莎。\n罗德岛先锋，企鹅物流辅助，近卫局主攻，行动正式开始。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十三关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"长官——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动的大部队已经撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官，我这边也处理完毕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——————啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"前些天抓住的那些整合运动嫌疑人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"刑讯科问出什么没有？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_21_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动嫌疑人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这把弩，你眼熟吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动嫌疑人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你能拉得动这把弩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个弹药是什么构造，怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们在贫民区做些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你来龙门，又要做些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动嫌疑人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些人什么都不说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或者说......他们可能什么都不知道吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就和刚刚解决的整合运动一样，应该都是些听话的喽啰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——让他们指认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"用点方法也不要紧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"小队信息，领导方式，来源，战术分布......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"有多少，让他们说多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他们说多少，就给我多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"无论有什么新消息，立刻通知我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"难道近卫局曾经抓捕过整合运动的成员？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"并不能确定他们的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"再怎么猜测，也只是怀疑而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"联系星熊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"特别督查组那边怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"还在被一个感染者——单方面压制吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"他们那里的整合运动似乎也已经撤退了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"忧心这是诱敌之计的星熊督察正在排查风险......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，一个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"想来就来，想走就走？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"下一步的任务，你应该也很清楚了，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，就是要夺回米莎吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一次联合作战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局主攻，罗德岛负责搜索和突袭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你们只要能拖慢整合运动的撤退进度，就算完成任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......了解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"搜索敌人的话......我们可能会被发现吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，我们的侦察小队也缺乏支援——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"光是我们可不成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"专业的事，就交给专家去做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡，帮我联络企鹅物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"又要麻烦能天使和德克萨斯他们两个了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局队员"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙兰卡"]}]}
